w","name":"Genshijin Crew","slug":"genshijin-crew","kind":"skill","summary":"原始人スタイル subagent への委譲判断ガイド。`genshijin-investigator` (コード位置特定)、 `genshijin-builder` (1-2ファイル編集)、`genshijin-reviewer` (diff レビュー) を inline作業 or vanilla `Explore` の代わりにスポーンするタイミングを示す。subagent 出力は原始人圧縮 → 主コンテキストに戻る tool-result が約60%縮小 → 長セッション持続。 Trigger: 「subagent 委譲」「genshijin-crew 使用」「investigator/builder/reviewer 起動」「コンテキスト節約」「圧縮 agent 出力」。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"interfacex-co-jp","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-crew"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-crew","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"genshijin-crew"},{"id":"skill:interfacex-co-jp:genshijin-help","name":"Genshijin Help","slug":"genshijin-help","kind":"skill","summary":"全 genshijin モード・スキル・コマンドのクイックリファレンスカード。 1回限り表示・モード変更なし・状態永続化なし。 「/genshijin-help」「原始人ヘルプ」「原始人の使い方」で起動。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"interfacex-co-jp","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-help"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-help","installability":"discovery_only","source":"feed:skills-sh","linkKey":"genshijin-help"},{"id":"skill:interfacex-co-jp:genshijin-review","name":"Genshijin Review","slug":"genshijin-review","kind":"skill","summary":"超圧縮PRレビューコメント。1行1指摘: 位置・問題・修正。前置き削除、シグナル優先。 日本語対応。「PRレビューして」「コードレビュー」「/review」「/genshijin-review」で起動。 プルリクエストレビュー時に自動起動候補。","category":"Agent Skills","publisher":{"name":"interfacex-co-jp","verified":false,"provenance":"awesome-list-claim","url":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-review"},"stars":null,"version":null,"skillSource":"https://www.skills.sh/interfacex-co-jp/genshijin/genshijin-review","installability":"discovery_only",